## Interface: 120100
## Title: WowCraft Export
## Notes: Exports the open profession's recipe schematics to SavedVariables, for the wowcraft margin scanner. Collection only - reads C_TradeSkillUI, touches nothing protected.
## Author: Zethrel - Argent Dawn EU
## Version: 0.11
## SavedVariables: WowCraftExportDB
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\Trade_BlackSmithing

# Written by `wowcraft.py scan`. Absent until the first scan with addon_path
# set, which the client tolerates - prices.lua guards for it either way.
PriceData.lua
main.lua
inventory.lua
auctions.lua
trade.lua
undercut.lua
prices.lua
# Reads the two tables the others leave behind - what you can make, and what
# each craft earns - so it has to load after both.
craft.lua
# And this one reads what craft.lua's list would cost to actually make.
shop.lua
